      "source": "theorem _root_.CompressionEval.smoke_an_02 (x y a b : ℝ) (hx : |x| ≤ a) (hy : |y| ≤ b) :\n  |x + y| ≤ a + b ∧ |x - y| ≤ a + b :=\nby\n  constructor\n  · exact (abs_add_le x y).trans (add_le_add hx hy)\n  · exact by simpa only [sub_eq_add_neg, abs_neg] using (abs_add_le x (-y)).trans (add_le_add hx (by simpa using hy))",
